message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Availability-Only Service Reconstruction for Google Cloud europe-west2"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Deng"
    given-names: "Zhehao"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zhehaodeng54-creator/SAC-europe-west2"
url: "https://github.com/zhehaodeng54-creator/SAC-europe-west2"
license: MIT
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-04
abstract: >-
  An availability-only reconstruction for six normalized cloud-service
  cohorts during the Google Cloud europe-west2 incident of 19-20 July 2022.
  Includes threshold sensitivity, leave-one-cohort-out analysis,
  alternative Filestore duration interpretations, cohort contributions,
  and tests of arithmetic consistency and within-window recovery.
keywords:
  - service availability
  - incident reconstruction
  - sensitivity analysis
  - Google Cloud
  - europe-west2
